# AGENTS.md — engineering rules for AI agents on low-latency trading systems

Binding for every agent and sub-agent working in this repo. If a request conflicts with these rules, stop and
say so. The agent files in `.github/agents/` define roles and workflow only; everything about *this domain*
lives here, in `.ai/review-checklists.md`, and in the specs.

## 1. Priorities
**Correctness > determinism > latency > everything else.** A fast wrong order is the worst outcome; a halted
strategy is better than an unsafe one.

